 ## فاز 11 — Autonomous Actions & Closed-Loop (بعدی)
+
+## ✅ فاز 11 — Autonomous Actions & Closed-Loop (انجام شد 2026-11-15)
+- Safety: `api/safety.py` — SIL2 PLd (IEC 61508/ISO 13849), 5-gate (emergency/mode/interlock/temp/vib/bounds/rate-limit), risk matrix Severity×Zone×Trust → CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW
+  - API: `GET /actions/safety/check` (allowed/reason/diag, SIL2)
+- Actions: `api/actions.py` — Policy Engine (4 policies POL-001..004, when/then SLA P1-P4) → Safety Gate → (Human Approval P1) → OPC Write + WorkOrder + Audit + Twin Sync
+  - WorkOrder ISO 55000 (NEW→CLOSED, SLA 1-168h), `EdgeQueue` ringbuf, HMAC audit
+  - API: `GET /actions/policies`, `POST /actions/evaluate,execute`, `POST /actions/approve/{id}`, `GET /actions/workorders,history`, `POST /actions/workorders/{id}/close`
+- Tauri 1.0.0-phase11: actions+safety در health_check + action_execute — 17-field
+- Test: 78/78 PASS (4+5+10+9+11+10+14+15) — safety bounds/emergency, CRDT, HMAC, derate auto, PENDING_APPROVAL
+
+## فاز 12 — Self-Healing & AIOps (بعدی)
